the source code of the tools, the homebrew rules and system design, and the
original prose written for this project (talent text, creature write-ups,
campaign material).

It does NOT cover material derived from Wizards of the Coast. That material is
used under two separate arrangements described in NOTICE, and we have no right
to sub-licence it to you. If you copy or fork this project, those arrangements
come with it -- in particular, the copy must remain free of charge and free of
access gates.

